{"ticker":"WTW","updated":"2026-10-30T23:23:42Z","profile":{"longName":"Willis Towers Watson Public Limited Company","shortName":"Willis Towers Watson Public Lim","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance Brokers","country":"United Kingdom","website":"https://www.wtwco.com","fullTimeEmployees":46900,"marketCap":29916790784,"trailingPE":19.927519,"forwardPE":14.136121,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.9118931,"pegRatio":1.27,"targetMeanPrice":369.89474,"targetHighPrice":455.0,"targetLowPrice":310.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.075,"earningsGrowth":0.044,"grossMargins":0.41824,"operatingMargins":0.19715,"profitMargins":0.15223,"totalRevenue":10273999872,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":351.51,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":240.61,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.2},"summary":"Willis Towers Watson Public Limited Company operates as an advisory, broking, and solutions company worldwide. The company operates through two segments: Health, Wealth & Career and Risk & Broking. It offers strategy and design consulting, plan management service and support, broking and administration services for health, wellbeing, and other group benefit programs, including medical, dental, disability, life, voluntary benefits, and other coverages; actuarial support, plan design, and administrative services for pension and retirement savings plans; retirement consulting services and solutions; and integrated solutions that consists of investment discretionary management, pension administration, core actuarial, and communication and change management assistance services. The company also provides advice, data, software, and products to address clients' total rewards and talent issues; and risk advice, insurance brokerage, and consulting services in the areas of property and casualty, affinity, risk and analytics, aerospace, construction, global markets direct and facultative, financial, executive and professional risks, credit risk solutions, crisis management, surety, marine, and natural resources. In addition, it offers software and technology, risk and capital management, products and product pricing, financial and regulatory reporting, financial and capital modeling, M&A,","summary_zh":"Willis Towers Watson Public Limited Company 是一家全球顧問、經紀和解決方案公司。該公司透過兩個部門運作：健康、財富與職業以及風險與經紀部門。它為健康、福祉和其他團體福利計劃（包括醫療、牙科、殘疾、人壽、自願福利和其他保險）提供策略和設計諮詢、計劃管理服務和支援、經紀和管理服務；退休金和退休儲蓄計劃的精算支援、計劃設計和行政服務；退休諮詢服務和解決方案；綜合解決方案，包括投資全權管理、退休金管理、核心協助服務以及溝通和協助管理服務。該公司還提供建議、數據、軟體和產品，以解決客戶的整體獎勵和人才問題；財產和傷亡、親和力、風險和分析、航空航太、建築、全球市場直接和臨時、金融、執行和專業風險、信用風險解決方案、危機管理、擔保、海洋和自然資源領域的風險諮詢、保險經紀和諮詢服務。此外，它還提供軟體和技術、風險和資本管理、產品和產品定價、財務和監管報告、財務和資本建模、併購、","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險經紀人","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":326.2,"h":328.65,"l":324.31,"c":325.46,"v":537300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":323.72,"h":327.72,"l":323.22,"c":327.19,"v":399000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":329.08,"h":332.62,"l":327.74,"c":329.84,"v":432400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":329.49,"h":331.44,"l":323.61,"c":329.27,"v":557200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":330.31,"h":333.05,"l":327.33,"c":332.23,"v":560000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":331.23,"h":333.46,"l":328.17,"c":329.48,"v":686200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":328.71,"h":330.95,"l":323.73,"c":330.22,"v":445600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":329.99,"h":340.76,"l":326.54,"c":340.45,"v":562800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":338.59,"h":341.25,"l":337.76,"c":338.79,"v":417900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":338.09,"h":338.72,"l":332.77,"c":333.7,"v":412600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":330.14,"h":332.51,"l":328.03,"c":330.72,"v":487400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":332.05,"h":336.27,"l":329.52,"c":332.33,"v":477200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":331.22,"h":334.07,"l":330.22,"c":331.7,"v":485300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":334.2,"h":340.38,"l":332.67,"c":336.71,"v":1309400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":336.57,"h":339.24,"l":334.52,"c":338.85,"v":565700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":338.1,"h":341.34,"l":337.02,"c":340.85,"v":451100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":340.85,"h":345.16,"l":338.68,"c":343.5,"v":565100},{"t":"