,"period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1140536/000119312526069307/wtw-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"WTW is a leading global advisory, broking and solutions company that provides data-driven, insight-led solutions in the areas of people, risk and capital. Utilizing the global view and local expertise of our approximately 47,000 colleagues serving more than 140 countries and markets, we help organizations sharpen strategies, enhance resilience, motivate workforces and maximize performance. We design and deliver solutions that manage risk, optimize benefits, cultivate talent and expand the power of capital to protect and strengthen institutions and individuals. Working closely with our clients, we uncover opportunities for sustainable success.","zh":"WTW 是一家全球領先的顧問、經紀和解決方案公司，在人員、風險和資本領域提供數據驅動、洞察力主導的解決方案。利用服務於 140 多個國家和市場的約 47,000 名同事的全球視野和本地專業知識，我們幫助組織完善策略、增強彈性、激勵員工並最大限度地提高績效。我們設計和提供管理風險、優化效益、培養人才和擴大資本力量的解決方案，以保護和加強機構和個人。我們與客戶密切合作，發現可持續成功的機會。"},{"en":"Our clients operate on a global and local scale in a multitude of businesses and industries throughout the world and generally range in size from large, major multinational corporations to middle-market domestic and international companies. Our clients include many of the world's leading corporations, including approximately 93% of the FTSE 100, 89% of the Fortune 1000, and 92% of the Fortune Global 500 companies. We also advise the majority of the world's leading insurance companies. We work with major corporations, emerging growth companies, governmental agencies and not-for-profit institutions in a wide variety of industries, with many of our client relationships spanning decades. None of the Company's clients individually represented more than 10% of its consolidated revenue for each of the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023. We place insurance with approximately 2,500 insu","zh":"我們的客戶在全球和本地範圍內開展業務，涉及世界各地的眾多企業和行業，其規模通常從大型跨國公司到中端市場的國內和國際公司。我們的客戶包括許多世界領先的企業，其中包括約 93% 的 FTSE 100 企業、89% 的財富 1000 強企業和 92% 的財富全球 500 強企業。我們也為大多數世界領先的保險公司提供諮詢服務。我們與各行各業的大型企業、新興成長型公司、政府機構和非營利組織合作，我們的許多客戶關係已經長達數十年。截至2025年12月31日、2024年及2023年各年度，本公司的客戶均未佔其合併收入的10%以上。我們為約2,500個保險投保"},{"en":"The Company files annual, quarterly and current reports, proxy statements and other information with the SEC. The SEC maintains a website that contains annual, quarterly and current reports, proxy statements and other information that issuers (including WTW) file electronically with the SEC. The SEC's website is www.sec.gov.","zh":"本公司向 SEC 提交年度、季度和當前報告、委託書和其他資訊。 SEC 維護的網站包含發行人（包括 WTW）以電子方式向 SEC 提交的年度、季度和當前報告、委託書以及其他資訊。 SEC 的網站是 www.sec.gov。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Health Wealth & Career","val":5328000000,"zh":"健康 財富與事業"},{"name":"Risk & Broking","val":4346000000,"zh":"風險與經紀"}],"total":9708000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":9428000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Broking","val":4334000000,"zh":"經紀業務"},{"name":"Consulting","val":3285000000,"zh":"諮詢"},{"name":"Outsourced Administration","val":1165000000,"zh":"外包管理"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":644000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":9708000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Foreign Countries","val":9565000000,"zh":"國外"},{"name":"US","val":4504000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":2996000000,"zh":"世界其他地區"},{"name":"GB","val":2065000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"IE","val":143000000,"zh":"愛爾蘭"}],"total":9708000000}},"peers":["AON","AJG","BRO","WRB","MRSH"]}}